<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's ASB Bank appoints new manager Managed Funds.</title>
<headline>NZ's ASB Bank appoints new manager Managed Funds.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASB Bank said on Friday it had appointed Kim White as chief manager of its Managed Funds.</p>
<p>White was formally with Prudential Assurance.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
